  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Summary 
 
 
 
 
 
 PBAS #: 
 
 
 
 220582
 
 
 
 
 
 FLA Period: 
 
 
 
 Nov 1, 2022 &amp;#8211; Jan 31, 2023
 
 
 
 
 
 Target Beneficiaries: 
 
 
 
 10,000 Beneficiaries
 
 
 
 
 
 Project Area: 
 
 
 
 Beliel, South Darfur State, Sudan
 
 
 
 
 
 Purpose/Objective: 
 
 
 
 To save lives through improved food and nutrition status whilst restoring livelihoods and enhancing communities resilience to shocks amongst the vulnerable Internally Displaced Persons, residents, returnees and refugees in South Darfur.
 
 Increased sustainable productive assets and livelihoods opportunities contributing to 2,000 increased communities resilience creating social cohesion/stability among returnees, residents (men and women) in Gialdi, Banat and Otash Village aligned to durable solutions by Jan 2023.
 
 
 
 
 
 Implementation modality: 
 
 
 
 Conditional Cash Transfers
 
 
 
 
 
 Type of Agreement: 
 
 
 
 New FLA
 
 
 
 
 
 Match spending status: 
 
 
 
 N/A
 
 
 
 
 
 Why a match is needed: 
 
 
 
 Match of $ 25,173 will be required to supplement the resources from WFP (as shown in the summary table below)</narrative>
  </description>
